  (b) RENAME REQUIREMENT
      Your Fork must be given a clearly distinct name that does not include
      "Vivy" or "Vivy AI" or any confusingly similar variation, as set out
      in Section 3.3.

  (c) LICENSE PROPAGATION
      Your Fork must be distributed under this same Vivy AI License,
      Version 1.0, without modification. You may not sublicense Your Fork
      under any other license, open-source or otherwise.

  (d) LINK TO ORIGIN
      The README or primary documentation of Your Fork must include a
      clearly visible statement such as:

          "This project is a fork of Vivy AI by Satyajeet Aich.
           Original Official Repository: https://github.com/Arthur-2407/Vivy-AI"

  (e) NON-COMMERCIAL
      Forks remain subject to Section 3.1 (Commercial Use). Publishing a
      Fork does not grant You any right to commercialise the Software or
      any Derivative Work derived from it.

  (f) MODIFICATION DISCLOSURE
      If Your Fork introduces significant modifications to core subsystems
      (e.g., AGI cognitive architecture, voice pipeline, perception engine,
      or internet intelligence layer), You must document those changes in a
      CHANGES.md or equivalent file included in Your Fork.

